胸にでっかい ファイトがもえる
A huge fighting spirit burns in our chests!

547
00:43:41,412 --> 00:43:46,372
とばせ正義の ハイウェイ
Speed down the highway of justice!

548
00:43:46,372 --> 00:43:51,552
マッハ・ゴー・ゴー・ゴー
Mach Go Go Go!

549
00:44:07,972 --> 00:44:12,532
うなるエンジン みなぎる闘志
Roaring engines, surging fighting spirit!

550
00:44:12,752 --> 00:44:16,732
負けてたまるか ゴー・ゴー・ゴー
We won't let ourselves lose, go, go, go!

551
00:44:16,972 --> 00:44:19,632
スーパーバトル マッハ号
Super Battle, Mach Go!

552
00:44:19,632 --> 00:44:22,312
いくぞ我が道 どこまでも
Wherever our path may lead!

553
00:44:22,312 --> 00:44:26,592
シフトチェンジに 力がこもる
Put all our strength into the shift change!

554
00:44:26,872 --> 00:44:31,592
レッドゾーンで 突き抜けろ
Break through into the red zone!

555
00:44:32,112 --> 00:44:37,592
マッハ・ゴー・ゴー・ゴー
Mach Go Go Go!

556
00:45:33,421 --> 00:45:34,361
Hey you know what?

557
00:45:34,561 --> 00:45:36,461
The rumor that you heard is True

558
