Trouble "Wan"der!

560
00:45:41,161 --> 00:45:43,281
Whenever Wherever

561
00:45:43,461 --> 00:45:44,501
We're in trouble

562
00:45:44,641 --> 00:45:46,261
She will come running, Run Run!

563
00:45:46,501 --> 00:45:48,061
Trouble "Wan"der!

564
00:45:48,581 --> 00:45:52,541
Up & Up & Down & Down & Left & Right & Left & Right &...

565
00:45:52,901 --> 00:45:55,361
Um... Let me see, what's next thing to do...

566
00:45:56,121 --> 00:46:00,001
Up & Up & Down & Down & Left & Right & Left & Right &...

567
00:46:00,361 --> 00:46:03,921
Doggy's back in Town!

568
00:46:04,121 --> 00:46:05,021
sniff sniff...oh find it!
Sniff, sniff... oh, found it!

569
00:46:05,221 --> 00:46:07,321
Dig here, bow wow wow.

570
00:46:07,521 --> 00:46:09,441
Mmm...there's nothing here!!
Mmm... there's nothing here!

