We had it made specially for this stream. The illustration is by Fukahire-sensei. Thank you as always!

621
00:49:18,998 --> 00:49:21,058
続いて、ころさんの耳カチューシャ！
Next is Korone's Ear Headband!

622
00:49:21,398 --> 00:49:27,718
某遊園地で売ってる耳が好きなので作ってもらいました！
I like the ears sold at a certain amusement park, so I had them made!

623
00:49:28,698 --> 00:49:30,738
続いて、毛玉ころねクリップ付きぬいぐるみ！
Next, the Fluffy Korone Plushie with Clip!

624
00:49:31,078 --> 00:49:37,618
これは肩につけることもできるので、お伴にしてお出かけしてください。
You can attach it to your shoulder, so please take it along with you when you go out.

625
00:49:39,078 --> 00:49:41,638
続いて、こちらころねすきクリップ付きぬいぐるみ！
Next, this Koroneski Plushie with Clip!

626
00:49:41,958 --> 00:49:46,558
